BODY=Exercise scripts/grant-oss.ts end to end: refuses without --stage, --inspect on ungranted repo, grant with cap/months shows blast radius, --add/--remove mutate only the repo list, private repo rejected, --revoke leaves the install on the standard gate. CLI only, no fixture PR.
